About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

Role Summary and Impact &nbsp;
&nbsp;
As Senior Activation Manager in Gothenburg, you will play a key leadership role across media activation teams and in WPP Media’s Gothenburg office. Our activation teams work within specialist areas of paid marketing, including paid social, paid search, programmatic&nbsp;advertising&nbsp;and tracking &amp; analytics. In this context, activation means turning media strategies into live campaigns by planning, setting up,&nbsp;optimizing,&nbsp;tracking&nbsp;and reporting on paid media activity across platforms and channels. &nbsp;
&nbsp;
You will lead,&nbsp;coach&nbsp;and develop Media Specialists across disciplines, while also contributing hands-on to client delivery. The role combines people leadership, operational&nbsp;excellence&nbsp;and senior activation&nbsp;expertise, with responsibility for ensuring high-quality campaign setup, optimization,&nbsp;reporting&nbsp;and delivery across disciplines. &nbsp;
&nbsp;
You will help build a strong, engaged and future-ready team by setting clear goals, supporting career development, driving&nbsp;collaboration&nbsp;and ensuring effective ways of working across client and specialist teams. A central part of the role is to strengthen delivery standards, improve efficiency and automation, support resource&nbsp;planning&nbsp;and help teams adopt new tools, methodologies and processes that improve quality,&nbsp;profitability&nbsp;and client outcomes. &nbsp;
&nbsp;
Working closely with activation leaders, team managers, client teams, People/HR and the wider Gothenburg leadership team, you will act as a role model and escalation point in complex delivery or client situations. Your impact will be measured through the development of high-performing specialists, strong client delivery, improved operational processes and a culture of continuous learning,&nbsp;collaboration&nbsp;and accountability. &nbsp;

